      "caption": "Compilers encode these rules in CallingConv TableGen files and clang's ABIInfo.",
      "narration": "LLVM backends encode the rules in TableGen files like X86CallingConv.td, and clang's ABIInfo classifies C types so frontend and backend agree.",
